15:T2aba,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ItemList","name":"Φωτοβολταϊκός Εξοπλισμός ProΣτέγη","numberOfItems":14,"itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Deye SUN-6K-SG04LP1","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Deye"},"sku":"INV-DEY-6K","description":"Ο δημοφιλέστερος μονοφασικός υβριδικός inverter για κατοικίες: 6 kW ισχύος, δύο MPPT και πλήρης αυτόνομη λειτουργία με μπαταρία 48V.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/deye-inverter.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/deye-sun-6k-sg04lp1","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":1190,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Deye SUN-8K-SG04LP1","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Deye"},"sku":"INV-DEY-8K","description":"Η ισχυρότερη μονάδα της σειράς SG04LP1: 8 kW συνεχόμενης ισχύος με 16A ανά MPPT — ιδανικός για πάνελ νέας γενιάς 700W και κατοικίες με αντλία θερμότητας.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/deye-inverter.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/deye-sun-8k-sg04lp1","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":1490,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Deye SUN-12K-SG04LP3","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Deye"},"sku":"INV-DEY-12K","description":"Τριφασικός υβριδικός inverter 12 kW για επαγγελματικά ακίνητα, αγροτικές μονάδες και κατοικίες με τριφασικό ρεύμα και υψηλές απαιτήσεις.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/deye-inverter.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/deye-sun-12k-sg04lp3","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":1890,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Deye SUN-20K-SG04HP3","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Deye"},"sku":"INV-DEY-20K","description":"Ο ναυαρχίδας της σειράς: 20 kW τριφασικής ισχύος με μπαταρίες high voltage 200–500V — σχεδιασμένο για αγροκαλλιέργειες, βιομηχανικές στέγες και μεγάλα συστήματα.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/deye-inverter.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/deye-sun-20k-sg04hp3","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":2980,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/PreOrder","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"V-TAC V11-48100 10.24 kWh","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"V-TAC"},"sku":"BAT-VTAC-10K","description":"Η μπαταρία που συνδυάζουμε στις περισσότερες εγκαταστάσεις: 10.24 kWh χρήσιμης ενέργειας LiFePO4, κρεμαστό σχέδιο που δεν καταλαμβάνει χώρο και 6.000+ κύκλοι ζωής.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/vtac-battery.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/vtac-10kwh-48v","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":1850,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Deye SE-G5.1 Pro 5.12 kWh","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Deye"},"sku":"BAT-DEY-5K","description":"Κομπακτική στοιβαζόμενη μπαταρία 5,12 kWh — η ιδανική λύση για να ξεκινήσετε με αποθήκευση και να επεκταθείτε αργότερα, μονάδα προς μονάδα.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/vtac-battery.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/deye-se-g5.1-pro","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":1250,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":7,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Deye High Voltage Rack 16.8 kWh","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Deye"},"sku":"BAT-DEY-HV16","description":"Επαγγελματικό σύστημα αποθήκευσης high voltage σε rack 19\": 16,8 kWh επεκτάσιμα έως 60 kWh, με BMS τύπου master-slave και εγγύηση 10 ετών.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/deye-rack.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/deye-hv-rack-16kwh","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":4450,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/PreOrder","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":8,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Φωτοβολταϊκό Πάνελ 500W Mono","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Tier-1 Manufacturer"},"sku":"PV-PNL-500","description":"Το πάνελ που επιλέγουμε για τις περισσότερες οικιακές εγκαταστάσεις: 500W με τεχνολογία half-cut PERC, αντοχή σε χαλάζι 25mm και εγγύηση απόδοσης 25 ετών.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/solar-panels.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/panel-500w-mono","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":105,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":9,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Φωτοβολταϊκό Πάνελ 700W N-Type TOPCon","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Tier-1 Manufacturer"},"sku":"PV-PNL-700","description":"Η νέα γενιά πάνελ N-Type TOPCon: 700W σε ένα πλαίσιο, απόδοση 22,3% και εγγύηση απόδοσης 30 ετών — περισσότερη ενέργεια ανά τ.μ. στέγης.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/solar-panels.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/panel-700w-topcon","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":152,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":10,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Πακέτο Net-Billing 5 kWp + 5 kWh","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"ProΣτέγη — Πακέτα"},"sku":"PKG-NET-5","description":"Το ολοκληρωμένο πακέτο για το μέσο ελληνικό σπίτι: 10 πάνελ 500W, υβριδικός inverter 6 kW, μπαταρία 5 kWh και πλήρης εγκατάσταση με άδειες.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/solar-panels.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/package-net-billing-5kwp","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":6850,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":11,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Πακέτο Υβριδικό Αυτονομίας 10 kWp + 20 kWh","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"ProΣτέγη — Πακέτα"},"sku":"PKG-HYB-10","description":"Σχεδόν πλήρης ενεργειακή ανεξαρτησία: 20 πάνελ, inverter 8 kW και 20 kWh αποθήκευση — για σπίτια με αντλία θερμότητας ή σε απομακρυσμένες περιοχές με ασταθές δίκτυο.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/solar-panels.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/package-hybrid-10kwp","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":14900,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":12,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Πακέτο Επαγγελματικό 30 kWp + 50 kWh","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"ProΣτέγη — Πακέτα"},"sku":"PKG-PRO-30","description":"Τριφασικό σύστημα για επιχειρήσεις με υψηλά λειτουργικά κόστη: 60 πάνελ TOPCon, inverter 20 kW, αποθήκευση 50 kWh σε high voltage racks.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/deye-rack.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/package-pro-30kwp","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":34500,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/PreOrder","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":13,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Σετ Στηρίγματος Κεραμοσκεπής (ανά πάνελ)","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"ProΣτέγη"},"sku":"ACC-STR-KRM","description":"Πλήρες σετ στηρίγματος για ένα πάνελ σε κεραμοσκεπή: οδηγοί αλουμινίου, τάπες στεγανότητας, κλιπ και βίδες ανοξείδωτες A2.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/solar-panels.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/kit-stirigma-keramidi","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":49,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":14,"item":{"@type":"Product","name":"Deye Wi-Fi Data Logger SE-WL-01","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Deye"},"sku":"ACC-DEY-WIFI","description":"Ο ενσωματωμένος Wi-Fi logger της Deye για inverters χωρίς ενσωματωμένο Wi-Fi: συνδέεται σε 2 λεπτά και στέλνει δεδομένα στη δωρεάν εφαρμογή.","image":"https://www.prostegi.gr/products/deye-inverter.png","url":"https://www.prostegi.gr/proionta/wifi-datalogger-deye","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"EUR","price":75,"itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ProΣτέγη"}}}}]}d:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex min-h-screen flex-col","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$15"}}],"$L16","$L17","$L18"]}],["$L19","$L1a"],"$L1b"]}]
