 με επεκτασιμότητα ανά μονάδα. Όλες οι μπαταρίες επικοινωνούν CAN/RS485 με τους inverter Deye για βέλτιστη διαχείριση φόρτισης."}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-2.5 self-start rounded-xl border border-[#2c7a3e]/20 bg-[#e9f3eb]/60 p-5","children":[["$","li","6.000+ κύκλοι ζωής LiFePO4",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#256d34]","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0","aria-hidden":true,"children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],"6.000+ κύκλοι ζωής LiFePO4"]}],["$","li","BMS ασφαλείας ενσωματωμένο",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#256d34]","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0","aria-hidden":true,"children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],"BMS ασφαλείας ενσωματωμένο"]}],["$","li","Κρεμαστό συμπαγές design",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#256d34]","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0","aria-hidden":true,"children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],"Κρεμαστό συμπαγές design"]}],["$","li","Επικοινωνία CAN/RS485 με Deye",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#256d34]","children":[["$","svg",null,{"