 τα πάνελ που χρησιμοποιούμε διαθέτουν εγγύηση προϊόντος 15–25 ετών και εγγύηση απόδοσης 25–30 ετών (80–87% της αρχικής ισχύος στο τέλος της περιόδου), πιστοποίηση αντοχής σε χαλάζι (IEC 61215) και επίστρωση ανθεκτική στη γύρη και τη σκόνη."}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-2.5 self-start rounded-xl border border-[#2c7a3e]/20 bg-[#e9f3eb]/60 p-5","children":[["$","li","Απόδοση 21%+ (PERC/TOPCon)",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#256d34]","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0","aria-hidden":true,"children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],"Απόδοση 21%+ (PERC/TOPCon)"]}],["$","li","Εγγύηση απόδοσης 25–30 ετών",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#256d34]","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0","aria-hidden":true,"children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],"Εγγύηση απόδοσης 25–30 ετών"]}],["$","li","Αντοχή σε χαλάζι & ισχυρούς ανέμους",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#256d34]","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0","aria-hidden":true,"children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],"Αντοχή σε χαλάζι & ισχυρούς ανέμους"]}],["$","li",